WEBVTT

00:40:59.246 --> 00:41:06.538
And and of course, a lot of it is that
by the time I met Brian, I was OK.

00:41:06.913 --> 00:41:12.746
You know, I was in a place that I was
able to see more clearly again

00:41:13.204 --> 00:41:18.663
and be more kind to myself and
to be truer to my nature

00:41:18.663 --> 00:41:21.496
and truer to my ambition and my vision.

00:41:22.329 --> 00:41:26.079
I was doing, again, what I'm here to do.

00:41:26.746 --> 00:41:30.538
And when you're doing that and then you
meet somebody else who's doing that,